VII. CONCLUSIONS AND FUTURE WORKS
In this study, we conducted a brief review of previous studies on the metaverse, its technologies, and their application to the transportation industry. We also reviewed the potential impact of these applications on transport systems. Furthermore, we examined two case studies that employ metaverse for transportation systems; they include Hundai’s motorstudio and WayRay’s Holograktor. We anticipate that this short study will shed more light on the impact of the metaverse on transportation industries.
